         OrbitControls.js (examples/jsm/controls/OrbitControls.js, with the
         bare `three` import rewritten to ./three.module.min.js).

react.js: the operator SPA's third-party runtime, emitted by the Vite build
(frontend/vite.config.ts, manualChunks) from node_modules - react, react-dom and
scheduler (MIT License, Copyright (c) Meta Platforms, Inc. and affiliates),
