Fonts (strands_robots/dashboard/static/fonts/, copied from frontend/public/fonts/
by the build): JetBrainsMono-wght.woff2 (JetBrains Mono, Copyright 2020 The
JetBrains Mono Project Authors, https://github.com/JetBrains/JetBrainsMono) and
SpaceGrotesk-wght.woff2 (Space Grotesk, Copyright 2020 Florian Karsten,
https://github.com/floriankarsten/space-grotesk), both under the SIL Open Font
License 1.1 (https://openfontlicense.org), as the variable latin builds Google
Fonts serves. They are the two typefaces the documentation site uses.

Vendored rather than fetched from a CDN so the dashboard renders on a robot LAN
with no internet. No other third-party browser code or asset is included; the twin's
geometry comes from the compiled MuJoCo model this process already holds.
